.TH pvc-fn-gen6 1  "pvc-fn-gen6 " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-fn\-gen6 \- gen6: uniform noise in `[\-1.0, 1.0)` (`legacy/cmusic_gen/gen/ gen6.c`), using the exact `rand()` sequence the C gets by never seeding one (glibc\*(Aqs default state, as if `srandom(1)` had been called) \- deterministic, not a fresh random table on every run
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-fn\-gen6\fR <\fB\-L\fR|\fB\-\-length\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
gen6: uniform noise in `[\-1.0, 1.0)` (`legacy/cmusic_gen/gen/ gen6.c`), using the exact `rand()` sequence the C gets by never seeding one (glibc\*(Aqs default state, as if `srandom(1)` had been called) \- deterministic, not a fresh random table on every run
